## Sabotage 1 (required): revert F1 predicate — `src/guards/permission-guard.ts`

Condition asserted: `shellTargetEscapesWorkspace` treats ANY leading `~`
(`if (trimmed.startsWith("~"))`) as a workspace escape → deny
`rule-0-shell-target-containment` for every role.

Sabotage (one line):
- before: `if (trimmed.startsWith("~")) {`
- after:  `if (trimmed === "~" || trimmed.startsWith("~/")) {`
- Method: native `edit` tool, single replacement in
  `src/guards/permission-guard.ts`.

Run:
```bash
bun test test/audit-20261018-remediation.test.ts -t "tilde-user-target-escape"
