- `shellTargetEscapesWorkspace unit semantics for tilde shapes` —
  `expect(...).toBe(true)` got `false`
- `legit controls still allow; literal ~foo over-blocks fail-closed` —
  `expect(overBlocked.allowed).toBe(false)` got `true`
(The `~`/`~/` control test passes on both predicates, as expected.)

